CS (Swarm)                O(i × n × d)                   O(n × d)                      
====================================================================================================

Notation:
  n = problem size (dimensions or cities)
  d = dimensions
  i = iterations
  p = population size
  k = archive/sample size
  g = generations
  a = number of ants
  b = branching factor
