Metric Definitions:
  - Best Cost: Lowest objective function value achieved
  - Time(s): Computational time in seconds
  - Conv.Speed: Iterations needed to reach 90% of final solution quality (lower is faster)
  - Robustness: Coefficient of Variation (std/mean) across multiple runs (lower is more robust)
  - Memory(MB): Peak memory usage during execution
