====================================================================================================
TSP DISCRETE OPTIMIZATION - COMPUTATIONAL COMPLEXITY ANALYSIS
====================================================================================================
Algorithm                 Time Complexity                Space Complexity              
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hill Climbing             O(n × k × d)                   O(d)                          
Genetic Algorithm         O(g × p × d)                   O(p × d)                      
ACO (Swarm)               O(i × a × n²)                  O(a × n)                      
Hybrid PSO (Swarm)        O(i × p × n²)                  O(p × n)                      
Firefly (Swarm)           O(i × n² × d)                  O(n × d)                      
ABC (Swarm)               O(i × n × d)                   O(n × d)                      
CS (Swarm)                O(i × n × d)                   O(n × d)                      
====================================================================================================

Notation:
  n = problem size (dimensions or cities)
  d = dimensions
  i = iterations
  p = population size
  k = archive/sample size
  g = generations
  a = number of ants
  b = branching factor
